---
description: Latvian full female name — one given name and one surname (Anna Bērziņa), given name first. The surname comes from person/female/lastName, so it reads -a or -e as Latvian requires; drawing it from person/lastName would produce Anna Bērziņš, which is not a name a Latvian register would accept.
generator: tdc
locale: lv
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="lv.person.female.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="lv.person.female.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
